<title>USA: Norand enters marketing agreement.</title>
<headline>Norand enters marketing agreement.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norand Corp said it entered into a marketing partnership agreement with MBA Consulting Corp.</p>
<p>MBA, which designs and implements computer systems for industrial and commercial applications, will offer Norand a marketing assistance program.</p>
<p>Norand designs and manufactures mobile computing systems and wireless data communications networks using radio frequency technology.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
